| 10 | 0.012795 | 0.070191 | 0.350389 | 0.617217 |
| 20 | 0.043174 | 0.043174 | 0.762492 | 0.762492 |
| 40 | 0.030276 | 0.056683 | 0.888991 | 0.944718 |
| 80 | 0.037432 | 0.037432 | 0.996377 | 0.996377 |


Corrected score comparison:

| n | exact_size | score_size | exact_power | score_power |
| ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: | ---: |
| 1 | 0.000000 | 0.000000 | 0.000000 | 0.000000 |
| 5 | 0.008560 | 0.008560 | 0.163080 | 0.163080 |
| 10 | 0.012795 | 0.012795 | 0.350389 | 0.350389 |
| 20 | 0.043174 | 0.011253 | 0.762492 | 0.583629 |
