| virginica | 50 | 5.552 | 0.5519 |


| label | statistic | p_value |
| :--- | ---: | ---: |
| Welch setosa-versicolor | -39.492719 | 9.934433e-46 |
| rank-sum setosa-versicolor | 0.000000 | 5.651012e-18 |
| ANOVA three species | 1180.161182 | 2.856777e-91 |
| Kruskal-Wallis three species | 130.411049 | 4.803974e-29 |
